  "description": "The ASP.NET Core and Blazor analyzer rules (ASPxxxx, BLxxxx) as strongly referenced constants, so that SuppressMessageAttribute takes compile-checked references instead of magic strings. Ids, categories, titles and help links are read from the analyzers' own DiagnosticDescriptor instances. Every Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web project runs these analyzers without installing anything. Unofficial; not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft.",
